    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Discontinuities — three flavours\n\nThe Heaviside step is the canonical **jump** discontinuity at $x = 0$. Define $g$ piecewise.\n",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "g(x) := if x < 0 then -1 else 1$\nx_g : np_to_list(np_linspace(-2, 2, 200))$\ny_g : map(lambda([x], float(g(x))), x_g)$\n\nax_draw2d(\n  color=\"blue\", line_width=2, name=\"step function\",\n  points(x_g, y_g),\n  title=\"Jump discontinuity at x = 0\",\n  xlabel=\"x\", ylabel=\"g(x)\",\n  grid=true, showlegend=true\n)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 24,
