    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "**Removable** ($\\sin(x)/x$ at $x=0$, with the value at 0 not defined or chosen wrong) and **essential** ($\\sin(1/x)$ near 0) round out the menagerie. The essential one oscillates infinitely often as $x \\to 0$.\n",
      "metadata": {}
    },
